      "content": "Thanks for that. One more thing—we've also noticed some very localized, irregular pitting and small voids in certain spots along the crack lines that don't seem to follow a clear pattern of settlement or wear. Is there any specific chemical or physical reaction that could cause that kind of sudden/localized degradation?",
